Third party code

The C engine, the JavaScript packages and the Java binding are original work and
carry no third party runtime dependencies. Nothing else is vendored into the
published artifacts beyond the engine itself:

  - the Java artifact bundles the compiled C engine as a native library per
    platform, built from the sources in core/ in this same repository
  - the npm packages bundle the same engine compiled to two WebAssembly modules,
    scalar and SIMD, built from those same sources

Build and test tooling (Maven, JUnit, Node, pnpm, TypeScript, Vite, Vitest, clang,
LLVM) is not redistributed and is not part of any published artifact.

